   ```
   - {id} in URL maps to method parameter
   - @PathVariable binds URL value to parameter
   - Name in annotation must match URL template variable

### Important Annotations
1. @GetMapping:
   - Handles HTTP GET requests
   - Maps URL pattern to method
   - Can include path variables

2. @PathVariable:
   - Binds URL template variables
   - Can specify name if different from parameter
   - Extracts values from URL path

